---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Monday InIT | Politechnika Wrocławska">
	<section id="home" class="hero">
		<div class="hero-bg"></div>
		<div class="container hero-content">
			<span class="badge">#IT #Networking #PWr</span>
			<h1 class="hero-title">Monday <span>InIT</span></h1>
			<p class="hero-subtitle">Największe wydarzenie technologiczne organizowane przez EKA.NET i Kredek</p>
			<div class="hero-details">
				<div class="detail-item">
					<svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><line x1="16" y1="2" x2="16" y2="6"></line><line x1="8" y1="2" x2="8" y2="6"></line><line x1="3" y1="10" x2="21" y2="10"></line></svg>
					<span>21 Października 2026</span>
				</div>
				<div class="detail-item">
					<svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z"></path><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"></circle></svg>
					<span>Budynek D-20, Politechnika Wrocławska</span>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="hero-actions">
				<a href="#register" class="btn-primary">Zarejestruj się</a>
				<a href="#agenda" class="btn-outline">Plan wydarzenia</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section id="speakers" class="speakers-section">
		<div class="container">
			<h2 class="section-title">Prelegenci</h2>
			<div class="speakers-grid">
				<!-- Speaker 1 -->
				<div class="speaker-card">
					<div class="speaker-img-wrapper">
						<div class="speaker-placeholder s1">JD</div>
					</div>
					<div class="speaker-info">
						<h3>Jan Kowalski</h3>
						<span class="speaker-role">Senior Software Engineer at TechCorp</span>
						<p class="speaker-desc">Specjalista z 10-letnim doświadczeniem w architekturze mikroserwisowej.</p>
						<div class="company-logo cl1">Logo Firmy</div>
					</div>
				</div>
				<!-- Speaker 2 -->
				<div class="speaker-card">
					<div class="speaker-img-wrapper">
						<div class="speaker-placeholder s2">AN</div>
					</div>
					<div class="speaker-info">
						<h3>Anna Nowak</h3>
						<span class="speaker-role">Lead Data Scientist at AI Lab</span>
						<p class="speaker-desc">Ekspertka w dziedzinie sztucznej inteligencji i analizy danych medycznych.</p>
						<div class="company-logo cl2">Logo Firmy</div>
					</div>
				</div>
				<!-- Speaker 3 -->
				<div class="speaker-card">
					<div class="speaker-img-wrapper">
						<div class="speaker-placeholder s3">PW</div>
					</div>
					<div class="speaker-info">
						<h3>Piotr Wiśniewski</h3>
						<span class="speaker-role">Cloud Architect at CloudSolutions</span>
						<p class="speaker-desc">Architekt rozwiązań chmurowych, specjalizujący się w AWS i Kubernetes.</p>
						<div class="company-logo cl3">Logo Koła</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section id="agenda" class="agenda-section">
		<div class="container">
			<h2 class="section-title">Agenda</h2>
			<div class="timeline">
				<div class="timeline-item">
					<div class="time">09:00 - 09:30</div>
					<div class="content">
						<h3>Rejestracja i powitalna kawa</h3>
						<p>Odbiór identyfikatorów i networking z uczestnikami.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="timeline-item">
					<div class="time">09:30 - 09:45</div>
					<div class="content">
						<h3>Otwarcie wydarzenia</h3>
						<p>Przywitanie uczestników przez przedstawicieli EKA.NET i Kredek.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="timeline-item">
					<div class="time">09:45 - 10:45</div>
					<div class="content">
						<h3>Przyszłość mikroserwisów w chmurze</h3>
						<p>Prelekcja: Jan Kowalski (TechCorp)</p>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="timeline-item break">
					<div class="time">10:45 - 11:15</div>
					<div class="content">
						<h3>Przerwa kawowa</h3>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="timeline-item">
					<div class="time">11:15 - 12:15</div>
					<div class="content">
						<h3>AI jako Twój Pair Programmer</h3>
						<p>Prelekcja: Anna Nowak (AI Lab)</p>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="timeline-item">
					<div class="time">12:15 - 13:15</div>
					<div class="content">
						<h3>Bezpieczeństwo w aplikacjach webowych</h3>
						<p>Prelekcja: Piotr Wiśniewski (CloudSolutions)</p>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="timeline-item break">
					<div class="time">13:15 - 14:00</div>
					<div class="content">
						<h3>Lunch i networking w strefie stoisk</h3>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section id="about" class="about-section">
		<div class="container">
			<h2 class="section-title">Organizatorzy</h2>
			<div class="about-grid">
				<div class="about-card eka">
					<div class="about-header">
						<h3>Koło Naukowe EKA.NET</h3>
					</div>
					<p>Jesteśmy kołem naukowym działającym przy Wydziale Elektrycznym Politechniki Wrocławskiej. Naszą misją jest popularyzacja wiedzy z zakresu nowoczesnych technologii programistycznych, w tym w szczególności stosu technologicznego .NET. Organizujemy warsztaty, prelekcje i realizujemy innowacyjne projekty akademickie.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="about-card kredek">
					<div class="about-header">
						<h3>Akademickie Stowarzyszenie Informatyczne Kredek</h3>
					</div>
					<p>Kredek to jedno z najstarszych kół naukowych na PWr, zrzeszające pasjonatów informatyki. Skupiamy się na wszechstronnym rozwoju - od programowania niskopoziomowego po zaawansowane aplikacje webowe. Wspólnie uczymy się, hakujemy i tworzymy niesamowite wydarzenia dla społeczności studenckiej.</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>

<style>
	/* Hero Section */
	.hero {
		min-height: 100vh;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		padding-top: 80px;
		position: relative;
		overflow: hidden;
	}

	.hero-bg {
		position: absolute;
		top: 0;
		left: 0;
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, rgba(157, 78, 221, 0.15) 0%, rgba(11, 15, 25, 1) 70%);
		z-index: -1;
	}

	.hero-bg::after {
		content: '';
		position: absolute;
		top: -50%;
		left: -50%;
		width: 200%;
		height: 200%;
		background: linear-gradient(45deg, transparent 45%, rgba(157, 78, 221, 0.05) 50%, transparent 55%);
		background-size: 3em 3em;
		z-index: -1;
		animation: moveGrid 20s linear infinite;
	}

	@keyframes moveGrid {
		0% {
			transform: translate(0, 0);
		}
		100% {
			transform: translate(3em, 3em);
		}
	}

	.hero-content {
		text-align: center;
		max-width: 800px;
		z-index: 1;
	}

	.badge {
		background: rgba(157, 78, 221, 0.2);
		color: #e0b1cb;
		padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
		border-radius: 999px;
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		letter-spacing: 1px;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		display: inline-block;
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
		border: 1px solid rgba(157, 78, 221, 0.4);
	}

	.hero-title {
		font-size: 5.5rem;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
		font-weight: 800;
		line-height: 1.1;
		letter-spacing: -2px;
	}

	.hero-title span {
		background: var(--gradient-primary);
		-webkit-background-clip: text;
		-webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
	}

	.hero-subtitle {
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		color: var(--text-muted);
		margin-bottom: 3rem;
		font-weight: 400;
	}

	.hero-details {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: center;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 2rem;
		margin-bottom: 3rem;
	}

	.detail-item {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.75rem;
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		color: #cbd5e1;
	}

	.detail-item svg {
		color: var(--secondary);
	}

	.hero-actions {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: center;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 1.5rem;
	}

	.btn-primary {
		background: var(--gradient-primary);
		color: white;
		padding: 1rem 2.5rem;
		border-radius: 999px;
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		transition: all 0.3s ease;
		box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(157, 78, 221, 0.3);
		min-width: 200px;
	}

	.btn-primary:hover {
		transform: translateY(-3px);
		box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(255, 0, 110, 0.4);
	}

	.btn-outline {
		background: transparent;
		color: white;
		padding: 1rem 2.5rem;
		border-radius: 999px;
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		border: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
		transition: all 0.3s ease;
		min-width: 200px;
	}

	.btn-outline:hover {
		border-color: white;
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
	}

	/* Speakers Section */
	.speakers-section {
		background-color: var(--surface-color);
	}

	.speakers-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
		gap: 2rem;
	}

	.speaker-card {
		background: var(--surface-color-light);
		border-radius: 20px;
		padding: 2.5rem 2rem;
		transition: transform 0.4s ease, box-shadow 0.4s ease;
		border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
		position: relative;
		overflow: hidden;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
	}

	.speaker-card:hover {
		transform: translateY(-10px);
		box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
		border-color: rgba(157, 78, 221, 0.3);
	}

	.speaker-img-wrapper {
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
		display: flex;
		justify-content: center;
	}

	.speaker-placeholder {
		width: 120px;
		height: 120px;
		border-radius: 50%;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		font-size: 2.5rem;
		font-weight: 800;
		color: white;
		box-shadow: inset 0 0 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
	}

	.speaker-placeholder.s1 { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4338ca, #3b82f6); }
	.speaker-placeholder.s2 { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #be185d, #ec4899); }
	.speaker-placeholder.s3 { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #047857, #10b981); }

	.speaker-info {
		text-align: center;
		width: 100%;
	}

	.speaker-info h3 {
		font-size: 1.5rem;
		margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
	}

	.speaker-role {
		display: block;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		color: var(--accent);
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
		font-weight: 500;
	}

	.speaker-desc {
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		color: var(--text-muted);
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
	}

	.company-logo {
		padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
		border-radius: 10px;
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 1px;
		border: 1px dashed rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
		margin-top: auto;
	}

	/* Agenda Section */
	.agenda-section {
		background-color: var(--bg-color);
	}

	.timeline {
		max-width: 800px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		position: relative;
	}

	.timeline::before {
		content: '';
		position: absolute;
		left: 120px;
		top: 0;
		bottom: 0;
		width: 2px;
		background: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent, rgba(157, 78, 221, 0.3) 10%, rgba(157, 78, 221, 0.3) 90%, transparent);
	}

	.timeline-item {
		display: flex;
		margin-bottom: 3rem;
		position: relative;
	}

	.timeline-item:last-child {
		margin-bottom: 0;
	}

	.timeline-item::after {
		content: '';
		position: absolute;
		left: 115px;
		top: 5px;
		width: 12px;
		height: 12px;
		border-radius: 50%;
		background: var(--bg-color);
		border: 2px solid var(--accent);
		z-index: 2;
		transition: all 0.3s ease;
	}

	.timeline-item:hover::after {
		background: var(--accent);
		box-shadow: 0 0 15px var(--accent);
	}

	.time {
		width: 120px;
		padding-right: 2rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: var(--accent);
		font-family: var(--font-heading);
		font-size: 1.1rem;
	}

	.content {
		flex: 1;
		padding-left: 3rem;
		background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02);
		padding: 1.5rem 2rem;
		border-radius: 16px;
		border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
		transition: transform 0.3s ease;
	}

	.timeline-item:hover .content {
		transform: translateX(5px);
		background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
		border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
	}

	.content h3 {
		font-size: 1.3rem;
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
		color: var(--text-main);
	}

	.content p {
		color: var(--text-muted);
		margin: 0;
	}

	.timeline-item.break .content {
		background: transparent;
		border: 1px dashed rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
	}

	.timeline-item.break .content h3 {
		color: var(--text-muted);
		font-weight: 500;
	}

	.timeline-item.break::after {
		border-color: var(--text-muted);
	}

	/* About Section */
	.about-section {
		background-color: var(--surface-color);
	}

	.about-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
		gap: 3rem;
	}

	.about-card {
		background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02);
		padding: 3rem;
		border-radius: 24px;
		border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
		position: relative;
		overflow: hidden;
		transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
	}

	.about-card:hover {
		transform: translateY(-5px);
		box-shadow: 0 15px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
	}

	.about-card::before {
		content: '';
		position: absolute;
		top: 0;
		left: 0;
		width: 100%;
		height: 4px;
	}

	.eka::before {
		background: linear-gradient(90deg, #9d4edd, #5a189a);
	}

	.kredek::before {
		background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ff006e, #fb5607);
	}

	.about-header h3 {
		font-size: 2rem;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}

	.about-card p {
		color: var(--text-muted);
		font-size: 1.05rem;
		line-height: 1.8;
	}

	@media (max-width: 900px) {
		.hero-title { font-size: 3.5rem; }
		.hero-details { flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; align-items: center; }
		.about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
		
		.timeline::before { left: 16px; }
		.timeline-item { flex-direction: column; }
		.timeline-item::after { left: 11px; top: 0; }
		.time { width: auto; padding-right: 0; margin-bottom: 1rem; padding-left: 2.5rem; }
		.content { padding-left: 2rem; margin-left: 16px; border-left: none; }
	}
</style>
